## 4. Cross-checks performed

- `wc -l ooda/oodac/x86_emit_shape_refuse.oo` → 238 (matches brief, within 256-line ceiling).
- `wc -l ooda/oodac/x86_emit.oo` → 211 (unchanged from prior pass).
- `grep -n 'x86_emit_shape_refuse_test' ooda/oodac/x86_emit.oo` → 1 hit (line 76), wired into the gate at lines 76-84.
- `grep -n 'x86_emit_shape_refuse.oo' ooda/oodac/x86_emit.oo` → 1 hit (line 43), import present.
- `grep -n 'x86_shape_float_signature\|x86_shape_3arm_match_signature\|x86_shape_result_signature\|x86_shape_struct_signature\|x86_shape_list_signature' ooda/oodac/x86_emit_shape_refuse.oo` → 5+1 hits (5 signature definitions + 1 delegation in x86_shape_result_real_handler at line 130).
- `grep -nE 'process_exit' ooda/oodac/x86_emit.oo` → 4 hits (lines 58, 62, 73, 85); every gate exits hard.
- Manual walk of each signature against the matching chain handler: confirmed in §1 above.

